 301:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c **** 
 302:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c **** /**
 303:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  * @brief  Update SystemCoreClock variable according to Clock Register Values.
 304:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *         The SystemCoreClock variable contains the core clock , it can
 305:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *         be used by the user application to setup the SysTick timer or configure
 306:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *         other parameters.
 307:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *
 308:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  * @note   Each time the core clock changes, this function must be called
 309:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *         to update SystemCoreClock variable value. Otherwise, any configuration
 310:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *         based on this variable will be incorrect.
 311:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *
 312:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  * @note   - The system frequency computed by this function is not the real
 313:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *           frequency in the chip. It is calculated based on the predefined
 314:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *           constant and the selected clock source:
 315:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *
 316:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *           - If SYSCLK source is CSI, SystemCoreClock will contain the CSI_VALUE(*)
 317:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *           - If SYSCLK source is HSI, SystemCoreClock will contain the HSI_VALUE(**)
 318:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *           - If SYSCLK source is HSE, SystemCoreClock will contain the HSE_VALUE(***)
 319:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *           - If SYSCLK source is PLL, SystemCoreClock will contain the CSI_VALUE(*),
 320:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *             HSI_VALUE(**) or HSE_VALUE(***) multiplied/divided by the PLL factors.
 321:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *
 322:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *         (*) CSI_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32h7xx_hal.h file (default value
 323:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *             4 MHz) but the real value may vary depending on the variations
 324:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *             in voltage and temperature.
 325:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *         (**) HSI_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32h7xx_hal.h file (default value
 326:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *             64 MHz) but the real value may vary depending on the variations
 327:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *             in voltage and temperature.
 328:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *
 329:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *         (***)HSE_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32h7xx_hal.h file (default value
 330:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *              25 MHz), user has to ensure that HSE_VALUE is same as the real
 331:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *              frequency of the crystal used. Otherwise, this function may
 332:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *              have wrong result.
 333:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *
 334:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *         - The result of this function could be not correct when using fractional
 335:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  *           value for HSE crystal.
 336:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  * @param  None
 337:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****  * @retval None
